  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine donations Covid-19 channelled through COVAX/GAVI to developing countries.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine donations through COVAX/GAVI. All vaccines are designated for ODA eligible countries. All vaccines reported are defined as &quot;in excess of domestic supply&quot; as they were not originally purchased with the sole intent of donating to ODA eligible countries. The average price of vaccines reported as ODA is above the threshold of USD 6.72. Vaccines to COVAX/GAVI donated by type: 2 988 000 (J&amp;J), 1 774 340 (AZ) and 927 200 (Moderna). For ODA reporting purposes the price of USD 6.72 is utilized as per recommendation by the OECD/DAC secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
